      <h2 id="zero-trust-risk-assessment" class="group scroll-mt-20">Risk assessment<a href="#zero-trust-risk-assessment" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>As the number of security policies in a cluster increase, visualization of what the policies allow and deny becomes increasingly important. These tools make it easier to create, visualize, and manage cluster security policies.</p>
